  "description": "After receiving help from a woman he meets for the first time, Leonard decides to repay her, completely unaware of what lies ahead. Unexpectedly, the reward she demands is to introduce him as her fiancé, entangling him with her for life. Irenea Blair, who lost her parents and was used before being killed by her uncle, mysteriously regresses to a time before she lost everything. Determined to protect her life and reclaim her former knight who broke his promise not to die before her, Irenea vows to safeguard him from losing anything this time.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70987189/)",
